The most recent full `npm test` attempt (69 total) reported **67 passed, 2 failed** under default test-file concurrency: `FLOW-SYSTEM-FACTS` expected a completed memory query but received `FAILED`; `SEC-HARD-03` expected a completed battery query but received `PARTIAL`. A serial retry (`npm test -- --test-concurrency=1`) reported **66 passed, 3 failed**: the same two plus `RECOVER-02`, whose setup session was inactive when the request ran. The full regression suite is not green; these existing system-fact/environment and timing/setup failures are outside gesture code and remain unresolved.

