## Rules

Never remove tests just to make a suite green. Never replace real behavior with production mocks. Label simulated tests honestly. Run all checks against the exact commit being accepted. Preserve unique acceptance criteria and source tests until the complete inventory is reviewed. Do not release or promote to `main` automatically.


